{
  "name": "dsh-maid-tts-fix",
  "description": "DSH 小困插件 · 朗读与音色维护层：给 dsh-xiaomi-tts 装上能跨行的 style/script 剥离，让 VCP 卡片的 CSS 不再被念出来；切会话不掐断朗读；隔壁会话跑完也自动念一遍；记忆反思轮不念、改念上一条；tts 标记写残（少一个 >）也照样认得；并在每次启动体检补丁是否还活着（登记 / hash / 落盘三项）。音色提示词与参照样本说明也收在这里。",
  "icon": "assets/plugin-icon.png",
  "version": "0.6.4",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "tts",
    "xiaomi",
    "mimo",
    "pnpm-patch",
    "vcp",
    "style-block",
    "read-aloud"
  ],
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib",
    "scripts",
    "patches",
    "voice-refs/prompt.md",
    "voice-refs/README.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "assets/plugin-icon.png"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./lib/selfcheck.js": "./lib/selfcheck.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
